  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "description": "How to read this dashboard.",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Keycloak: single sign-on for the lab\n**What it does here.** Realm `staffops` holds the users and the OIDC clients of Argo CD, Grafana, Vault, Dependency-Track\n(browser logins) and of the MCP clients `hermes`, `backstage`, `keycloak-mcp` (client_credentials). The Gateway `mcp`\nchecks Keycloak JWTs. If Keycloak is down nobody can log in to those tools (existing sessions keep working until their\ntokens expire) and MCP calls with new tokens fail.\n\n**Healthy looks like:** UP, availability 100 %, ≥ 95 % of authentication requests under 250 ms, < 0.1 % server errors\n(the SLO examples of the [Keycloak SLI guide](https://www.keycloak.org/observability/keycloak-service-level-indicators)),\nDB pool with no waiting threads, heap well below max.\n\n**Failed logins are not outages.** `invalid_user_credentials` or `invalid_client_credentials` show users or clients with\na wrong password/secret (or someone guessing). Server errors (5xx) and DB pool exhaustion are outages.\n\n**When something is red:** `kubectl --context k8s01 -n keycloak logs keycloak-0`; DB → the CloudNativePG dashboard\n(Databases folder, cluster `keycloak-db`); client secrets → `docs/runbooks/sso.md`. Latency and event panels need the\nmetrics options set in `helm-charts/keycloak` (`KC_HTTP_METRICS_HISTOGRAMS_ENABLED`, `KC_HTTP_METRICS_SLOS=250`,\n`KC_EVENT_METRICS_USER_ENABLED`): empty until that change is synced.",
        "code": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Active alerts for this service",
      "id": 20,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Prometheus alerts of this service that are FIRING (condition true for longer than the rule's `for`) or PENDING (condition true, waiting for `for`). Same filter as the red alert annotations of this dashboard; Watchdog/InfoInhibitor are excluded. Empty = healthy. Alertmanager has no receiver in this lab, so dashboards are where alerts are seen: the rule, its threshold and source are in the rule files (helm-charts/<app>/**/prometheus.rules.yaml or the -raw release) and in docs/dashboards/. All alerts of the lab: dashboard \"Alerts overview\" (Observability folder).",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "ALERTS{alertname!~\"Watchdog|InfoInhibitor\", alertstate=~\"firing|pending\", namespace=\"keycloak\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          },
          "noValue": "No active alerts"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "alertstate"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "state"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background",
                  "mode": "basic"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "firing": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "pending": {
                        "color": "orange",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "severity"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "critical": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "warning": {
                        "color": "orange",
                        "index": 1
                      },
                      "info": {
                        "color": "blue",
                        "index": 2
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "prometheus": true,
              "endpoint": true,
              "service": true,
              "instance": true,
              "uid": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "alertname": 0,
              "alertstate": 1,
              "severity": 2,
              "namespace": 3
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
